Error [E0338]: Computed field `Stats.threat` forms a cycle through `attack`
  --> tests/ui/computed_field_cycle.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     threat: Int -> attack + 1
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A computed field's formula may only reference OTHER fields — the dependency graph among computed fields must have no cycle
 Fix: Break the cycle: make `threat` or `attack` a plain stored field, or rework the formula
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0338
